From: Bastiaan van der Plaat <bastiaan.v.d.plaat@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 18:46:52 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Turn slower when running

Running doubles the speed of turning with the arrow keys, which goes
round in under three seconds. The d-pad always runs, so that is the speed
the DS gets, too fast to aim with. Running turns half as fast again as
walking instead.
---
 Game/src/player.c | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Game/src/player.c b/Game/src/player.c
index 1bb1d30..89baba2 100644
--- a/Game/src/player.c
+++ b/Game/src/player.c
@@ -2016,7 +2016,8 @@ void getinput(short snum)
 
     if (running)
     {
-        turnamount = NORMALTURN<<1;
+        // Half as fast again instead of twice, the d-pad always runs
+        turnamount = NORMALTURN + (NORMALTURN>>1);
         keymove = NORMALKEYMOVE<<1;
     }
     else
